		{"id":"a4b1c1d1e1f10001","type":"text","text":"# LinuxShell\n\n**模块说明**：Shell 变量、环境、PATH、命令替换 + 流程控制、函数、数组、调试、Expect、子 Shell\n\n— 3 个笔记 —","x":-110,"y":-280,"width":260,"height":60,"color":"6"},
